{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論文九十三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如先所說\n者，如第八像觀所說，觀彌陀三十二相八十種好等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《無為集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《了齋集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《寶王論》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《鐔津集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此傳見大藏養字函"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一佛剎約以一三千\n大千世界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出觀心法界圖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《東坡大全》。若準大宋《高僧》，則云圓觀法師。未知孰是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失其\n縣名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "J20n0086_p0232b12"}
